    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prop Sumo is a physics-driven fighting game that pits ordinary props together in extraordinary battles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUTPLAY YOUR FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal in Prop Sumo is to be the <strong>last prop standing</strong>. Brawl your opponents with a variety of melee moves, or just launch yourself into them with a powerful charge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash a chain of combo attacks and send your friends flying in every direction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/c1ad264ea8e5b28f27acdc4660044a52.poster.avif?t=1753377908\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/c1ad264ea8e5b28f27acdc4660044a52.webm?t=1753377908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/c1ad264ea8e5b28f27acdc4660044a52.mp4?t=1753377908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR ULTIMATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your playstyle with <strong>wild prop modifiers</strong> that transform your ultimate ability in powerful ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn, disarm, magnetise, fracture, chill and daze - unlock over 16 modifiers and craft the perfect ultimate-modifier combo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/a375de9dc0de63944c33b8fe9cbfd838.poster.avif?t=1753377908\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/a375de9dc0de63944c33b8fe9cbfd838.webm?t=1753377908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/a375de9dc0de63944c33b8fe9cbfd838.mp4?t=1753377908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EPIC ARENAS, EPIC FIGHTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out on <strong>stunning, dynamic maps</strong> built for mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From surging rivers to tangled vines and molten lava, only you can decide if they're threats or knockout opportunities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/741e9f98015cecfbfc35c34639f69905.poster.avif?t=1753377908\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/741e9f98015cecfbfc35c34639f69905.webm?t=1753377908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/741e9f98015cecfbfc35c34639f69905.mp4?t=1753377908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARN IT ALL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience from every fight to <strong>unlock coupons!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redeem them to unlock new strategic ultimate-modifier combinations and express your style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/0032d23b0b701cb040e05380fae58a19.poster.avif?t=1753377908\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/0032d23b0b701cb040e05380fae58a19.webm?t=1753377908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/0032d23b0b701cb040e05380fae58a19.mp4?t=1753377908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STYLE YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your prop with a <strong>huge selection of cosmetic items!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tweak the position, scale and rotation of each accessory to design your unique look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/e254b1232efd9baaedb7bd363ff140d1.poster.avif?t=1753377908\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/e254b1232efd9baaedb7bd363ff140d1.webm?t=1753377908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/e254b1232efd9baaedb7bd363ff140d1.mp4?t=1753377908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SET THE RULES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the chaos</strong> your way - add lives, disable hazards, remove round timers, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want an intense 1v1 or a laid-back free-for-all, you're in control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 playable props</strong>, each with unique modifiers to shake up your playstyle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 powerful ultimate abilities</strong>, combinable with modifiers for over 100 incredible combinations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 dynamic maps</strong>, perfect for groups from 2 to 6 players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep customisation system</strong> to style your prop your way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and unlocks</strong> tied to experience and accolades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training Dojo</strong> to master moves and combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Host settings and private lobbies</strong> for full control over your matches!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prop Sumo is <strong>peer-to-peer only</strong> and best enjoyed with friends. However, we have a <strong>server browser</strong> so you can jump into matches against strangers too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We're developing Prop Sumo with player feedback at the core, so please send us your feedback over on the Steam Forums and Prop Sumo Discord server!</i> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prop Sumo is a physics-driven fighting game that pits ordinary props together in extraordinary battles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUTPLAY YOUR FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal in Prop Sumo is to be the <strong>last prop standing</strong>. Brawl your opponents with a variety of melee moves, or just launch yourself into them with a powerful charge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash a chain of combo attacks and send your friends flying in every direction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/c1ad264ea8e5b28f27acdc4660044a52.poster.avif?t=1753377908\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/c1ad264ea8e5b28f27acdc4660044a52.webm?t=1753377908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/c1ad264ea8e5b28f27acdc4660044a52.mp4?t=1753377908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR ULTIMATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your playstyle with <strong>wild prop modifiers</strong> that transform your ultimate ability in powerful ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn, disarm, magnetise, fracture, chill and daze - unlock over 16 modifiers and craft the perfect ultimate-modifier combo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/a375de9dc0de63944c33b8fe9cbfd838.poster.avif?t=1753377908\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/a375de9dc0de63944c33b8fe9cbfd838.webm?t=175337