032d23b0b701cb040e05380fae58a19.mp4?t=1753377908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STYLE YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your prop with a <strong>huge selection of cosmetic items!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tweak the position, scale and rotation of each accessory to design your unique look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/e254b1232efd9baaedb7bd363ff140d1.poster.avif?t=1753377908\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/e254b1232efd9baaedb7bd363ff140d1.webm?t=1753377908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089420/extras/e254b1232efd9baaedb7bd363ff140d1.mp4?t=1753377908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SET THE RULES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the chaos</strong> your way - add lives, disable hazards, remove round timers, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want an intense 1v1 or a laid-back free-for-all, you're in control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 playable props</strong>, each with unique modifiers to shake up your playstyle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 powerful ultimate abilities</strong>, combinable with modifiers for over 100 incredible combinations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 dynamic maps</strong>, perfect for groups from 2 to 6 players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep customisation system</strong> to style your prop your way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and unlocks</strong> tied to experience and accolades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training Dojo</strong> to master moves and combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Host settings and private lobbies</strong> for full control over your matches!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prop Sumo is <strong>peer-to-peer only</strong> and best enjoyed with friends. However, we have a <strong>server browser</strong> so you can jump into matches against strangers too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We're developing Prop Sumo with player feedback at the core, so please send us your feedback over on the Steam Forums and Prop Sumo Discord server!</i> </p>",
